2026-07-27T09:29:06.0246229Z i /tmp/RtmppD06oY/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:29:06.0246700Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:29:06.0247286Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:29:06.0247790Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:29:06.0248559Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:29:06.0249713Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:29:06.0250938Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
